@startuml
actor User
participant Main
participant SourceCodeFile
participant SecurityAuditVisitor
participant "Security report" as Report
User -> Main: run demonstration
Main -> SourceCodeFile: new SourceCodeFile(...)
Main -> SecurityAuditVisitor: new visitor
Main -> SourceCodeFile: accept(visitor)
SourceCodeFile -> SecurityAuditVisitor: visit(this)
SecurityAuditVisitor -> SecurityAuditVisitor: inspect credentials and risk
SecurityAuditVisitor -> Report: add issue and score
Main <-- Report: print report
@enduml
